<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Reaping wheat and barley, death and resurrection,</l><l>Though the loss sustained our old man often grieves;</l><l>But in life abundant, life in resurrection,</l><l>Coming to the meeting, bringing in the sheaves.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Grain and wine and oil—bringing in the surplus</l><l>Of the wheat and barley, vine and olive trees:</l><l>Wine to cause rejoicing, oil to give anointing,</l><l>Bringing in the top tenth, bringing in the sheaves.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
